  customer-facing documentation.\n55\t- The TrustyAI guardrails integration documented as a supported configuration,\n56\t  including its support boundary.\n57\t- Dashboard default enablement for entitled clusters reflected in\n58\t  documentation (removal of the TP opt-in instructions).\n59\t- Removal or correction of Tech Preview caveats and disclaimers that no\n60\t  longer apply at GA.\n61\t\n62\t## Acceptance Criteria\n63\t\n64\t- Documentation covering installation, configuration, the versioned API\n65\t  surface, deprecation policy, and upgrade path is published at GA standard.\n66\t- Migration notes exist for each of the last two Tech Preview releases and\n67\t  are technically accurate against the tested upgrade path.\n68\t- All GA-scope deliverables (support posture, supported TrustyAI guardrails\n69\t  integration, Dashboard default enablement) are reflected in published\n70\t  documentation.\n71\t- No Tech Preview caveats or experimental-flag instructions remain in the\n72\t  Llama Stack documentation set.\n73\t- The documentation is technically reviewed against the implementation by\n74\t  someone with knowledge of the delivered GA scope.\n75\t\n76\t## HLR Traceability\n77\t\n78\t- HLR-6 (P2): Documentation is uplifted to GA standards, including migration\n79\t  notes from TP.\n80\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a22b4aa7fc2fd455","agent_id":"a407ea3694e046104","session_id":"39ecee98-99e4-452a-b2b9-dea59d7dddfe","uuid":"c0dd116f-49f0-4ccf-adad-5f7b2919e647","timestamp":"2026-10-26T15:14:05.664Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-adcc33a029ea4141","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
